  "title": "Carolyn's Holiday Fruit Bread",
  "description": "This moist, easy-to-make applesauce, raisin and walnut bread has roots in Victorian England where it was traditional at the end of the year to use up canned fruit in Christmas breads. It also makes the perfect holiday gift.",
  "authors": [
